System libraries
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The SDK links `libbz2` via a system-library shim (`sdk/Sources/CBZ2`) to inflate
BSDIFF40 patch payloads. `libbz2` ships with the macOS and iOS SDKs and is not
vendored, redistributed or modified by this project. bzip2 is Copyright (C)
1996-2019 Julian R Seward, under the BSD-style bzip2 license.


