Verifying this list
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The authoritative dependency set is `cli/Package.resolved` and
`sdk/Package.resolved`. After changing a dependency, re-resolve and update this
file. Each dependency's own LICENSE file is fetched into `.build/checkouts/`.

